+        <p class="room__b">In the wordmark the digit is drawn a shade apart, and at small scales it steps out alone: the favicon, the stamp, the embroidery are just the 8, turned. The long word lives on the façade; the short mark lives everywhere else. Two assets, one gesture.</p>
