+        <p class="room__b">The house name is long, so the sub-brands must stay short and the lockups must breathe. The digit remains the counting device: eight stations, eight-week blocks, the 8 read at intake. Same spine as age8, carried by a longer beam.</p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="room rv" data-d="3">
+        <span class="room__role">The voice</span>
+        <p class="room__h">Teach the <em>wink</em>, once</p>
+        <p class="room__b">The launch line writes itself: spelled longevit8, pronounced longevitate. Say it once on every surface for a season, then never explain it again. English copy keeps the turn: age, without the ending. Romanian copy gets the full warm word back.</p>
