+    <p class="body rv" style="margin-top:1.2rem;max-width:66ch">The register prices the pair very differently: age8 walks into an empty field, longevit8 stands in the shadow of the category's most defended word. If the room loves the longevitate wink but the lawyers wince, the short form is the same idea with the risk taken out.</p>
