+      <div class="card rv" data-d="2"><span class="klabel"><svg class="ico"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg> 2 · Fence the cheap domains</span><p class="h3" style="margin-top:.6rem">Both names, under €25</p><p class="body" style="margin-top:.4rem">age8 for about €12, longevit8 for about €10. Both .ro domains are confirmed open: register them, and the handles, the same day a name advances. The .com question stays open for both: age8.com and longevit8.com are registered, and who holds them, and whether they can be acquired, is still to be clarified.</p></div>
